#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:66 imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:411
#: imageplugin_noisereduction.cpp:63
msgid "Noise Reduction"
msgstr "Reduzón de Ruído"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:68
msgid "A noise reduction image filter plugin for digiKam."
msgstr "Unha extensión de digiKam de filtro redutor do ruído da imaxe."

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:74
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autor e mantedor"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:77
msgid "Noise Reduction algorithm. Developer"
msgstr "Autor do algoritmo de reduzón de ruído. Desenvolvente"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:88
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Detalles"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:90
msgid "Radius:"
msgstr "Rádio:"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:95
msgid ""
"<p><b>Radius</b>: this control selects the gliding window size used for the "
"filter. Larger values do not increase the amount of time needed to filter "
"each pixel in the image but can cause blurring. This window moves across the "
"image, and the color in it is smoothed to remove imperfections. In any case "
"it must be about the same size as noise granularity or somewhat more. If it "
"is set higher than necessary, then it can cause unwanted blur."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:109
msgid "Threshold:"
msgstr "Limiar:"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:114
msgid ""
"<p><b>Threshold</b>: use the slider for coarse adjustment, and the spin "
"control for fine adjustment. This controls edge detection sensitivity. This "
"value should be set so that edges and details are clearly visible and noise "
"is smoothed out. Adjustment must be made carefully, because the gap between "
"\"noisy\", \"smooth\", and \"blur\" is very small. Adjust it as carefully as "
"you would adjust the focus of a camera."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:127
msgid "Texture:"
msgstr "Textura:"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:132
msgid ""
"<p><b>Texture</b>: this control set the texture accuracy. This value can be "
"used, to get more or less texture accuracy. When decreased, then noise and "
"texture are blurred out, when increased then texture is amplified, but also "
"noise will increase. It has almost no effect to image edges."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:142
msgid "Sharpness:"
msgstr "Afiamento:"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:147
msgid ""
"<p><b>Sharpness</b>: This value improves the frequency response for the "
"filter. When it is too strong then not all noise can be removed, or spike "
"noise may appear. Set it near to maximum, if you want to remove very weak "
"noise or JPEG-artifacts, without loosing detail."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:158
msgid "Edge Lookahead:"
msgstr "Distáncia de Procura cara diante:"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:163
msgid ""
"<p><b>Edge</b>: This value defines the pixel distance in which the filter "
"looks ahead for Edges. When this value is increased, then spikenoise is "
"erased. You can eventually readjust filter <b>Edge</b>, when you changed "
"this setting. When this value is to high, then the adaptive filter cannot "
"longer accurately track image details, and noise can reappear or blur can "
"occur."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:175
msgid "Erosion:"
msgstr "Erosión:"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:180
msgid ""
"<p><b>Erosion</b>: Use this to increase edge noise erosion and spike noise "
"erosion. (noise is removed by erosion)"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:193
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avanzado"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:195
msgid "Luminance:"
msgstr "Lumináncia:"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:200
msgid ""
"<p><b>Luminance</b>: this control set the luminance tolerance of image. It's "
"recommended to use only <b>Color</b> or <b>Luminance</b> tolerance settings "
"to make an image correction, not the both at the same time. This settings "
"don't influence the main smoothing process controled by <b>Details</b> "
"settings."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:210
msgid "Color:"
msgstr "Cor:"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:215
msgid ""
"<p><b>Color</b>: this control set the color tolerance of image. It's "
"recommended to use only <b>Color</b> or <b>Luminance</b> tolerance settings "
"to make an image correction, not the both at the same time. This settings "
"don't influence the main smoothing process controled by <b>Details</b> "
"settings."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:225
msgid "Gamma:"
msgstr "Gama:"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:230
msgid ""
"<p><b>Gamma</b>: this control set the gamma tolerance of image. This value "
"can be used to increase the tolerance values for darker areas (which "
"commonly are more noisy). This results in more blur for shadow areas."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:239
msgid "Damping:"
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:244
msgid ""
"<p><b>Damping</b>: this control set the phase jitter damping adjustement. "
"This value defines how fast the adaptive filter-radius reacts to luminance "
"variations. If increased, then edges appear smoother, if too high, then blur "
"may occur. If at minimum then noise and phase jitter at edges can occur. It "
"can supress spike noise when increased and this is the preferred method to "
"remove it."
msgstr ""

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:418
msgid "Photograph Noise Reduction Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Ficheiro de Configurazón da Reduzón de Ruído da Imaxe a Carregar"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:430
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Noise Reduction settings text file."
msgstr "\"%1\" non é un ficheiro de texto de configurazón da reduzón de ruído da imaxe."

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:451
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Noise Reduction text file."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel ler a configurazón do ficheiro de texto de configurazón "
"da reduzón de ruído da imaxe."

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:460
msgid "Photograph Noise Reduction Settings File to Save"
msgstr "Ficheiro de Configurazón da Reduzón de Ruído da Imaxe onde Guardar"

#: imageeffect_noisereduction.cpp:483
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Photograph Noise Reduction text file."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel guardar a configurazón no ficheiro de "
"texto de Reduzón de Ruído da Imaxe."

#: imageplugin_noisereduction.cpp:43
msgid "Noise Reduction..."
msgstr "Reduzón de Ruído..."

